# Evidence and receipt artifacts. Probability artifacts, GUI and focus render captures, MCP receipts,
# analysis dumps and 3D pipeline reports are machine-generated and regenerable, so they stay local like
# the rest of the working evidence. Markdown handoffs, specs, and the inputs that .tools tests read stay
# tracked: the negations below re-include those inputs, and a file that a maintained tool reads for a
# new reason is added with git add -f.
